a) Vì $\triangle {IGH}$ là tam giác cân (do $IG=IH$) nên $\widehat{G_{1}}=\widehat{H_{1}}$.\\
Do đó $\widehat{G_{1}}+\widehat{H_{1}}+\widehat{I_{1}}=2 \widehat{G_{1}}+\widehat{I_{1}}=180^{\circ}$.\\
